zorin-optimizer (0.2.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Reliability rewrite: ship the backend package in the wheel/.deb (the
    0.1.0 package could not start at all).
  * Simulate mode now gates every mutating action, including gsettings,
    file writes, icon packs and config import/export.
  * Fix Timeshift buttons, the double-executing async runner, GTK updates
    from worker threads, and ignored command exit codes.
  * Two-query installed-state detection instead of ~60 subprocesses on the
    UI thread; batch APT/Flatpak commands behind one polkit prompt.
  * Correct the app catalogue (removed five un-installable Flatpak IDs),
    validate IDs and presets, and add APT alternatives.
  * Optimize page is diff-based: it no longer deletes an existing swapfile
    or ZRAM config on every run.
  * Harden tar extraction against traversal/links, atomic .desktop and CSS
    edits, psutil-independent dashboard.
  * Add headless doctor CLI, GUI smoke tests and 25 regression tests.

 -- Zorin Optimizer <noreply@example.com>  Tue, 27 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000

